asset:        fx-switch.aep
title:        After Effects project fixture: the fx switch of an effect instance (two Gaussian Blurs on one layer, the first switched off, the second on)
author:       vangel76 (contributor)
source:       original work
license:      MIT OR Apache-2.0
added:        2026-10-28 by vangel76
notes:        Generated from scratch by the contributor with Adobe After Effects 2026 from the base project of the corpus (one composition C, one red solid L): two Gaussian Blur instances (Blurriness 40) added through scripting, the first switched off by hand in the Effect Controls; one save. Own test data for the effectcraft-aep tests; contains only synthetic project structure, no third-party footage, presets, templates or personal data. No Adobe sample project or asset was used. The XMP packet after the project container was replaced by the (smaller) packet of the base project.
